      "message": "Tried that first and it can\u0027t work: GerritServer pins sshd.threads to 1 for every acceptance test, and interactiveThreads \u003d max(1, poolSize - batchThreads), so the interactive queue always has exactly one thread. The second uploadpack then never gets a thread to park on — it just sits READY and the test times out. sshd.batchThreads is the only queue size a test can actually set.",
